    <title>Notion 批量导出 PDF：递归读取与高保真渲染</title>
    <link href="/2026/08/02/notion-batch-exporter/"/>
    <url>/2026/08/02/notion-batch-exporter/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Notion 单页导出很方便，但面对多篇笔记和多层子页面时，逐个操作会很麻烦。</p><p>因此我做了一个本地命令行工具：<a href="https://github.com/Five0Nine/notion-batch-exporter">Notion Batch Exporter</a>。它通过 Notion 官方 API 读取已授权页面，将内容递归转换为 PDF，不需要浏览器 Cookie，也不会把私人笔记上传到第三方服务。</p><h2 id="实现效果"><a href="#实现效果" class="headerlink" title="实现效果"></a>实现效果</h2><p>工具支持：</p><ul><li>同时导出多个页面</li><li>按标题搜索并多选</li><li>递归导出所有普通子页面</li><li>分别保存 PDF，或合并为一个文件</li><li>保留封面、图标、颜色、Callout、多栏和表格</li><li>浅色与深色主题</li><li>生成 <code>manifest.json</code>，记录页面层级和导出警告</li></ul><p>一次完整导出的处理流程是：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">Notion API → 页面树 → HTML/CSS → Chromium → PDF → 合并与清单<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="递归读取页面"><a href="#递归读取页面" class="headerlink" title="递归读取页面"></a>递归读取页面</h2><p>Notion 的页面内容由 Block 组成。读取一个 Block 后，如果它还有子内容，就继续向下请求；遇到 <code>child_page</code> 时，则记录为下一轮需要读取的页面。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">_read_block_tree</span>(<span class="hljs-params">client, parent_id, child_page_ids</span>):<br>    blocks = client.block_children(parent_id)<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> block <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> blocks:<br>        block_type = block.get(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;type&quot;</span>)<br><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> block_type == <span class="hljs-string">&quot;child_page&quot;</span>:<br>            child_page_ids.append(block[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;id&quot;</span>])<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">continue</span><br><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> block.get(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;has_children&quot;</span>):<br>            block[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;_children&quot;</span>] = _read_block_tree(<br>                client,<br>                block[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;id&quot;</span>],<br>                child_page_ids,<br>            )<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> blocks<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>外层使用 <code>ThreadPoolExecutor</code> 同时读取同一层级的兄弟页面。为了避免并发请求过快，所有线程共用一个请求调度器，将请求起始速率控制在约每秒三次。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">_wait_for_request_slot</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self</span>):<br>    interval = <span class="hljs-number">1.0</span> / <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.rate_limit_per_second<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">with</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>._pace_lock:<br>        now = time.monotonic()<br>        scheduled = <span class="hljs-built_in">max</span>(now, <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>._next_request_at)<br>        <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>._next_request_at = scheduled + interval<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> scheduled &gt; now:<br>        time.sleep(scheduled - now)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>遇到 <code>429</code> 或临时服务器错误时，程序会读取 <code>Retry-After</code> 并自动退避重试。</p><h2 id="还原-Notion-样式"><a href="#还原-Notion-样式" class="headerlink" title="还原 Notion 样式"></a>还原 Notion 样式</h2><p>直接使用轻量 PDF 库很难还原 Notion 的颜色、封面和多栏布局。因此高保真模式会先把页面 Block 转换成语义化 HTML，再通过 CSS 映射 Notion 的文字色和背景色。</p><p>最后使用 Playwright 调用 Chromium 的打印引擎：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python">builder = NotionHTMLBuilder(<br>    document,<br>    include_properties=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>,<br>    theme=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;light&quot;</span>,<br>)<br><br>page.set_content(builder.build())<br><br>page.pdf(<br>    path=<span class="hljs-built_in">str</span>(destination),<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">format</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;A4&quot;</span>,<br>    print_background=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>,<br>    prefer_css_page_size=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>,<br>    display_header_footer=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>,<br>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这样可以利用浏览器成熟的排版能力，同时保留背景颜色、中文字体、多栏、表格和分页效果。如果本机没有 Chromium，工具也可以回退到 ReportLab 轻量渲染器。</p><h2 id="输出与合并"><a href="#输出与合并" class="headerlink" title="输出与合并"></a>输出与合并</h2><p>每个页面会按照原有父子关系保存到对应目录，文件名附带页面 ID 前八位，避免同名笔记互相覆盖。</p><p>需要合并时，程序使用 <code>pypdf</code> 按页面树顺序写入一个新文件：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python">writer = PdfWriter()<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> pdf_file <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> pdf_files:<br>    reader = PdfReader(<span class="hljs-built_in">str</span>(pdf_file))<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> page <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> reader.pages:<br>        writer.add_page(page)<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">with</span> destination.<span class="hljs-built_in">open</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;wb&quot;</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">as</span> stream:<br>    writer.write(stream)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="使用方式"><a href="#使用方式" class="headerlink" title="使用方式"></a>使用方式</h2><p>创建只读 Notion Integration，并把 Token 放入环境变量后，可以直接搜索并选择页面：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">notion-export pick <span class="hljs-string">&quot;会议记录&quot;</span> \<br>  --recursive \<br>  --mode both \<br>  --renderer chromium \<br>  --theme light \<br>  --workers 3 \<br>  -o ./exports<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>其中：</p><ul><li><code>--recursive</code>：递归读取子页面</li><li><code>--mode both</code>：同时保留独立 PDF 和合并 PDF</li><li><code>--renderer chromium</code>：使用浏览器高保真渲染</li><li><code>--workers 3</code>：并发读取页面</li><li><code>-o</code>：指定输出目录</li></ul><h2 id="项目边界"><a href="#项目边界" class="headerlink" title="项目边界"></a>项目边界</h2><p>工具只能读取明确授权给 Integration 的页面。为了避免意外导出大型数据库，<code>child_database</code> 不会被自动展开，需要手动选择其中的页面。</p><p>Notion API 也不会提供部分客户端视觉信息，例如封面焦点位置和原生图标 SVG，因此最终结果接近 Notion，但并不是客户端截图。</p><p>这个项目的重点不是完全复制 Notion，而是提供一种可批量、可审计、尽量保持原样，同时让私人笔记留在本机的导出方式。</p><p>项目源码与安装包：</p><ul><li><a href="https://github.com/Five0Nine/notion-batch-exporter">GitHub 仓库</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/Five0Nine/notion-batch-exporter/releases/tag/v0.3.0">v0.3.0 Release</a></li></ul>]]></content>
    
    
